(6799779, 1022177, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nice touch to photograph the head through the wings. Not sure what to make of the horizontal lines in the background. On the one hand, their repetitive pattern mimics the lines in the wings, which is cool. On the other hand, they distract my attention somewhat from the bird. On balance, though, I like this shot a lot. Well done.</td>', 'Nice touch to photograph the head through the wings. Not sure what to make of the horizontal lines in the background. On the one hand, their repetitive pattern mimics the lines in the wings, which is cool. On the other hand, they distract my attention somewhat from the bird. On balance, though, I like this shot a lot. Well done.', '2012-06-22 01:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
