(6799859, 1021896, 101668, '<td valign="top">Awesome clarity and detail.</td>', 'Awesome clarity and detail.', '2012-06-22 02:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799872, 1021341, 108580, '<td valign="top">Classic humorous animal photo and title. WD. Turn it into a motivational poster <a href="//bighugelabs.com/motivator.php" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here</a> :)</td>', 'Classic humorous animal photo and title. WD. Turn it into a motivational poster here :)', '2012-06-22 02:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799875, 1022290, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great compo and fabulous focus and eye colour. Good BG. Not liking the branch to the right FG.</td>', 'Great compo and fabulous focus and eye colour. Good BG. Not liking the branch to the right FG.', '2012-06-22 02:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799885, 1022015, 108580, '<td valign="top">I know how hard it is to do BiF. The most frustrating part is that they always fly away from you. Kudos for sharpness and stop motion and an exposure which emphasises the detail in the feathers but the head/eye is dark and quartering away.</td>', 'I know how hard it is to do BiF. The most frustrating part is that they always fly away from you. Kudos for sharpness and stop motion and an exposure which emphasises the detail in the feathers but the head/eye is dark and quartering away.', '2012-06-22 02:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799888, 1022150, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely study. Unusual subject. Great detail, sharp eye, great POV/Comp and BG</td>', 'Lovely study. Unusual subject. Great detail, sharp eye, great POV/Comp and BG', '2012-06-22 03:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799889, 1022322, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely study. Great detail, sharp eye, great POV/Comp and BG and reflection.</td>', 'Lovely study. Great detail, sharp eye, great POV/Comp and BG and reflection.', '2012-06-22 03:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799891, 1022137, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely study. Great detail, sharp eyes, great POV/Comp and BG. Also perfect timing and interactive shot.</td>', 'Lovely study. Great detail, sharp eyes, great POV/Comp and BG. Also perfect timing and interactive shot.', '2012-06-22 03:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799899, 1021918, 108580, '<td valign="top">I love to see birds photographed in at least a natural environment (hummer with flower not hummer with feeder or no feeder/flower at all), much more difficult and challenging. Great POV and good BG albeit with a fair bit of noise. Nice catchlight and very shallow DOF.</td>', 'I love to see birds photographed in at least a natural environment (hummer with flower not hummer with feeder or no feeder/flower at all), much more difficult and challenging. Great POV and good BG albeit with a fair bit of noise. Nice catchlight and very shallow DOF.', '2012-06-22 03:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799902, 1021867, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wonderful clarity and colour, crisp and detailed. The foliage is far too green for Southern Africa (now winter browns) so I''m guessing zoo? Still a 7.<br/> <br/>Amazing birds now threatened in Africa due habitat destruction of the overpopulated and unnecessarily protected African elephant destroying vast tracts of bush and flattening trees where these birds breed.</td>', 'Wonderful clarity and colour, crisp and detailed. The foliage is far too green for Southern Africa (now winter browns) so I''m guessing zoo? Still a 7. Amazing birds now threatened in Africa due habitat destruction of the overpopulated and unnecessarily protected African elephant destroying vast tracts of bush and flattening trees where these birds breed.', '2012-06-22 03:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799903, 1022294, 108580, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot, great BG, crisp and perfect POV. Top Marks.</td>', 'Fabulous shot, great BG, crisp and perfect POV. Top Marks.', '2012-06-22 03:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799904, 1022040, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great shot of what we call a Grey Headed Gull. Almost looks like you''re up there with him.</td>', 'Great shot of what we call a Grey Headed Gull. Almost looks like you''re up there with him.', '2012-06-22 03:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799905, 1022235, 108580, '<td valign="top">Love these belligerent looking birds. Great detail in the feathers and especially that enormous night vision eye. Lovely flat BG.</td>', 'Love these belligerent looking birds. Great detail in the feathers and especially that enormous night vision eye. Lovely flat BG.', '2012-06-22 03:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799906, 1022249, 108580, '<td valign="top">whahahah! I''m guessing not too many people are getting this right? Kudo''s for the kahunas. "Where the Fakawe! Where the Fakawe?"</td>', 'whahahah! I''m guessing not too many people are getting this right? Kudo''s for the kahunas. "Where the Fakawe! Where the Fakawe?"', '2012-06-22 03:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799907, 1022012, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely and unusual study. Pity the head is just a tad hidden.</td>', 'Lovely and unusual study. Pity the head is just a tad hidden.', '2012-06-22 03:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799908, 1021950, 108580, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rendering and exposure. Most unusual.</td>', 'Beautiful rendering and exposure. Most unusual.', '2012-06-22 03:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799913, 1021262, 108580, '<td valign="top">Beautiful in their ugliness. Great image. May however not do so well in a site were pristine, shiny and sexy is all the rage. Might surprise though.</td>', 'Beautiful in their ugliness. Great image. May however not do so well in a site were pristine, shiny and sexy is all the rage. Might surprise though.', '2012-06-22 03:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799914, 1022264, 108580, '<td valign="top">Beautiful study, crisp, good catchlight, lovely environment, 3D due distant and soft BG. Nice pose and comp.</td>', 'Beautiful study, crisp, good catchlight, lovely environment, 3D due distant and soft BG. Nice pose and comp.', '2012-06-22 03:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799915, 1021268, 108580, '<td valign="top">The bird-man cometh...</td>', 'The bird-man cometh...', '2012-06-22 03:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799919, 1022232, 108580, '<td valign="top">Crested Guinea''s! Was Patrys chasing them? :) They are funny birds and so highly strung. Nice action shot, great backlight in the feathers.</td>', 'Crested Guinea''s! Was Patrys chasing them? :) They are funny birds and so highly strung. Nice action shot, great backlight in the feathers.', '2012-06-22 03:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799921, 1022114, 108580, '<td valign="top">Unique image. Most enjoyable. Great lighting and golden colours.</td>', 'Unique image. Most enjoyable. Great lighting and golden colours.', '2012-06-22 04:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799922, 1021867, 674, '<td valign="top">From the foliage I would think this is a zoo shot!</td>', 'From the foliage I would think this is a zoo shot!', '2012-06-22 04:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799923, 1021909, 108580, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting and spot on the eye. Great BG and complimentary tones. Most unusual portrait style.</td>', 'Awesome lighting and spot on the eye. Great BG and complimentary tones. Most unusual portrait style.', '2012-06-22 04:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799924, 1022248, 674, '<td valign="top">Beautiful little Jewel! One of my favourite birds!</td>', 'Beautiful little Jewel! One of my favourite birds!', '2012-06-22 04:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799930, 1022150, 54446, '<td valign="top">Amazing feather detail.  Great colors.  9  I''m totally stumped as to identity of species.  Must not be found in North America.</td>', 'Amazing feather detail.  Great colors.  9  I''m totally stumped as to identity of species.  Must not be found in North America.', '2012-06-22 04:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799934, 1021880, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good osprey.  Pretty good control of the lighting, which has caused some bright areas and dark areas.  Some artifacts.</td>', 'Good osprey.  Pretty good control of the lighting, which has caused some bright areas and dark areas.  Some artifacts.', '2012-06-22 04:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799935, 1021767, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait. Great BG and crisp subject.</td>', 'Lovely portrait. Great BG and crisp subject.', '2012-06-22 04:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799936, 1022286, 108580, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing! Did he get it?</td>', 'Perfect timing! Did he get it?', '2012-06-22 04:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799937, 1021769, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely study and reflection.</td>', 'Lovely study and reflection.', '2012-06-22 04:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799959, 1022184, 107708, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2012-06-22 05:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799960, 1022197, 108580, '<td valign="top">Stunning stop motion and clarity on the eye specifically. Good comp. Not sure about the banding in the BG? What always concerns me about hummer shots is that they are attracted in(to) artificial feeders and thus it is relatively easy to prefocus and snap away. I prefer to see a flower with the bird. Still a 7.</td>', 'Stunning stop motion and clarity on the eye specifically. Good comp. Not sure about the banding in the BG? What always concerns me about hummer shots is that they are attracted in(to) artificial feeders and thus it is relatively easy to prefocus and snap away. I prefer to see a flower with the bird. Still a 7.', '2012-06-22 05:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799962, 1021412, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely study, nice and close, great detail in the feathers and a warm bright (evil) glow in the sharp eye. Super that you got environment as well. Looks suspiciously like a Male Cape Weaver (Southern Africa)?</td>', 'Lovely study, nice and close, great detail in the feathers and a warm bright (evil) glow in the sharp eye. Super that you got environment as well. Looks suspiciously like a Male Cape Weaver (Southern Africa)?', '2012-06-22 06:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799965, 1022197, 81042, '<td valign="top">soft, sharp, motion yet stand still. fabulous. top 3</td>', 'soft, sharp, motion yet stand still. fabulous. top 3', '2012-06-22 06:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799966, 1022281, 81042, '<td valign="top">fabulous focus and color. well done.</td>', 'fabulous focus and color. well done.', '2012-06-22 06:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799967, 1021883, 81042, '<td valign="top">running out the door so don''t have time to vote. If I get a chance to come back to it it would be a 9. Awesome shot. Top 3. Squeezed the vote in :)</td>', 'running out the door so don''t have time to vote. If I get a chance to come back to it it would be a 9. Awesome shot. Top 3. Squeezed the vote in :)', '2012-06-22 06:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799968, 1022015, 129807, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and sharp, great detail in the feathers and the exposure is well done. The technicals are well looked after in this shot, but I feel the composition could have been more exciting - wings up instead of down maybe, or flying toward instead of away. I appreciate the difficulty in even getting this shot in the first place - well done.</td>', 'Beautiful and sharp, great detail in the feathers and the exposure is well done. The technicals are well looked after in this shot, but I feel the composition could have been more exciting - wings up instead of down maybe, or flying toward instead of away. I appreciate the difficulty in even getting this shot in the first place - well done.', '2012-06-22 06:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799969, 1021605, 129807, '<td valign="top">I''m sure others have already mentioned it, but that brown blade of grass is in a really bad spot :( Also, the focus is on the green grass, not the bird, and although this may have been your intention, for me personally it doesn''t appeal.</td>', 'I''m sure others have already mentioned it, but that brown blade of grass is in a really bad spot :( Also, the focus is on the green grass, not the bird, and although this may have been your intention, for me personally it doesn''t appeal.', '2012-06-22 06:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799971, 1022185, 129807, '<td valign="top">Dynamic composition, but it makes me want to see more! I want to be able to see the feet, the wing tips and the end of his tail! Maybe this was your intention - hmmm. Well it made me look longer...</td>', 'Dynamic composition, but it makes me want to see more! I want to be able to see the feet, the wing tips and the end of his tail! Maybe this was your intention - hmmm. Well it made me look longer...', '2012-06-22 06:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799972, 1022033, 129807, '<td valign="top">I know you know, but the focus is on the rear bird. As the fore-bird is so central to your composition and also obviously has something to say, I would have preferred the focus to be on it instead.</td>', 'I know you know, but the focus is on the rear bird. As the fore-bird is so central to your composition and also obviously has something to say, I would have preferred the focus to be on it instead.', '2012-06-22 06:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799973, 1022137, 129807, '<td valign="top">Excellent dof. The bird on the left of shot looks ever-so-slightly soft, but this draws my attention more to the act of feeding and the bird on the right with that wonderful detail in the wings.</td>', 'Excellent dof. The bird on the left of shot looks ever-so-slightly soft, but this draws my attention more to the act of feeding and the bird on the right with that wonderful detail in the wings.', '2012-06-22 06:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799974, 1022251, 129807, '<td valign="top">The focus is dead-on the bird - I just wish I could see more of him!</td>', 'The focus is dead-on the bird - I just wish I could see more of him!', '2012-06-22 06:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799976, 1021767, 129807, '<td valign="top">Excellent feather and face detail and I really like the light on his face.</td>', 'Excellent feather and face detail and I really like the light on his face.', '2012-06-22 06:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799977, 1022302, 129807, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the bird is well placed within the frame. I''m not overly fond of the processing you''ve applied. I like it on the background, but not on the bird and the wire.</td>', 'I like the composition, the bird is well placed within the frame. I''m not overly fond of the processing you''ve applied. I like it on the background, but not on the bird and the wire.', '2012-06-22 06:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799978, 1022294, 129807, '<td valign="top">Terrific capture - even the poor fish is facing the right direction! The water drop is an added bonus. Great detail in the feathers and sharp all round.</td>', 'Terrific capture - even the poor fish is facing the right direction! The water drop is an added bonus. Great detail in the feathers and sharp all round.', '2012-06-22 06:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799979, 1022152, 129807, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, with all elements placed well within the shot. Soft focus and the tones applied work well for this shot. But I have to say, I personally think the vignette is too obvious/hard and maybe would have worked better a different (dark) colour?</td>', 'Composition is good, with all elements placed well within the shot. Soft focus and the tones applied work well for this shot. But I have to say, I personally think the vignette is too obvious/hard and maybe would have worked better a different (dark) colour?', '2012-06-22 06:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799980, 1022367, 129807, '<td valign="top">Love those outspread wings. Not sure, but maybe I would have tried a much tighter crop? to remove most of the background (distracting) foliage.</td>', 'Love those outspread wings. Not sure, but maybe I would have tried a much tighter crop? to remove most of the background (distracting) foliage.', '2012-06-22 06:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799982, 1022031, 129807, '<td valign="top">Postcard stuff - gorgeous. Those swans really glow. I''ll be interested to find out who this belongs to (I have a suspicion, but may be wrong..) Composition, check. Detail, check. Colour &amp; focus, check. Emotional connection, check. Oh, let''s face it, you know you''ve got a great shot! :)</td>', 'Postcard stuff - gorgeous. Those swans really glow. I''ll be interested to find out who this belongs to (I have a suspicion, but may be wrong..) Composition, check. Detail, check. Colour & focus, check. Emotional connection, check. Oh, let''s face it, you know you''ve got a great shot! :)', '2012-06-22 06:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799983, 1022265, 129807, '<td valign="top">Wow, I respect you purely for attempting a shot like this! However, I feel the focus is on the feeder instead of the bird, and the feeder takes up too much of the frame. Maybe a tighter crop? There''s no way I''d ever have the patience to try this.</td>', 'Wow, I respect you purely for attempting a shot like this! However, I feel the focus is on the feeder instead of the bird, and the feeder takes up too much of the frame. Maybe a tighter crop? There''s no way I''d ever have the patience to try this.', '2012-06-22 06:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799984, 1022250, 129807, '<td valign="top">I like the capture, composition and catchlight. The image seems very contrasty (is that even a word?!) on my monitors.</td>', 'I like the capture, composition and catchlight. The image seems very contrasty (is that even a word?!) on my monitors.', '2012-06-22 07:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799985, 1021816, 129807, '<td valign="top">Hullo Cocky! Great Australian bird, nice detail. The background doesn''t do this shot any favours, sorry :( Love how you can see the line detail in the beak.</td>', 'Hullo Cocky! Great Australian bird, nice detail. The background doesn''t do this shot any favours, sorry :( Love how you can see the line detail in the beak.', '2012-06-22 07:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799987, 1021835, 129807, '<td valign="top">This shot is obviously about the birds and the man feeding them, but I became so interested in the location - trying to work out what it is (a sandy beach up against a retaining wall?) that I stopped seeing it as a ''bird'' image. The conversion to b&amp;w works well I think.</td>', 'This shot is obviously about the birds and the man feeding them, but I became so interested in the location - trying to work out what it is (a sandy beach up against a retaining wall?) that I stopped seeing it as a ''bird'' image. The conversion to b&w works well I think.', '2012-06-22 07:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799989, 1021316, 129807, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of processing. Not to my tastes personally as to me, this seems overprocessed, but to each their own. With a retro/grunge border I can see this on an arty greeting card.</td>', 'Interesting choice of processing. Not to my tastes personally as to me, this seems overprocessed, but to each their own. With a retro/grunge border I can see this on an arty greeting card.', '2012-06-22 07:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799990, 1022197, 129807, '<td valign="top">Wow. Just wow. Focus perfect where it needs to be, soft where it needs to be. Wing movement enough to suggest movement without being blurred to non-existence. Excellently applied vignette. My one critique is that I can see black &amp; green horizontal lines, but only to the bottom right of the bird. One of my top scorers so far.</td>', 'Wow. Just wow. Focus perfect where it needs to be, soft where it needs to be. Wing movement enough to suggest movement without being blurred to non-existence. Excellently applied vignette. My one critique is that I can see black & green horizontal lines, but only to the bottom right of the bird. One of my top scorers so far.', '2012-06-22 07:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799992, 1022090, 129807, '<td valign="top">You''ve probably received heaps of comments about the tilt - I''m in the ''too much'' category, sorry. Otherwise, this is a sharp, technically well done image. I think I''d''ve preferred portrait orientation with no tilt, but I''ve never seen the original shot, so wouldn''t even know if this was possible.</td>', 'You''ve probably received heaps of comments about the tilt - I''m in the ''too much'' category, sorry. Otherwise, this is a sharp, technically well done image. I think I''d''ve preferred portrait orientation with no tilt, but I''ve never seen the original shot, so wouldn''t even know if this was possible.', '2012-06-22 07:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799993, 1022298, 129807, '<td valign="top">Ummm... excellent feather detail and also on the red bit (whatever that bit''s called), absolutely love that sheen on the feathers, but what sort of bird is it? It kinda looks a bit weird because it''s beak is buried in it''s feathers.</td>', 'Ummm... excellent feather detail and also on the red bit (whatever that bit''s called), absolutely love that sheen on the feathers, but what sort of bird is it? It kinda looks a bit weird because it''s beak is buried in it''s feathers.', '2012-06-22 07:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799994, 1022150, 129807, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but the first thing I thought when this loaded was ''it''s stuffed, not real''. So sorry if this isn''t the case :(</td>', 'I''m sorry, but the first thing I thought when this loaded was ''it''s stuffed, not real''. So sorry if this isn''t the case :(', '2012-06-22 07:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799995, 1022249, 129807, '<td valign="top">As in ''where the....?'' LOL. I''ll give you a point for humour.</td>', 'As in ''where the....?'' LOL. I''ll give you a point for humour.', '2012-06-22 07:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799996, 1022371, 129807, '<td valign="top">Love the sheen on the feathers and the colours you''ve captured - beautiful. This is a very documentary style shot, so I don''t personally get an emotional type connection to it, which I think the best wildlife shots have.</td>', 'Love the sheen on the feathers and the colours you''ve captured - beautiful. This is a very documentary style shot, so I don''t personally get an emotional type connection to it, which I think the best wildlife shots have.', '2012-06-22 07:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799997, 1022366, 129807, '<td valign="top">This almost looks painted - love the effect on the bird, not so much on the water. I would maybe have cropped all those rocks at the top off to leave a landscape orientation with room for the bird to ''walk into''.</td>', 'This almost looks painted - love the effect on the bird, not so much on the water. I would maybe have cropped all those rocks at the top off to leave a landscape orientation with room for the bird to ''walk into''.', '2012-06-22 07:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799998, 1022324, 129807, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and detail. I feel this shot was maybe taken in very strong light, which has resulted in deep shadows and flat tones. I wouldn''t know how to correct that, sorry :( But that sheen on lorikeet feathers is hard to beat isn''t it? :)</td>', 'Excellent focus and detail. I feel this shot was maybe taken in very strong light, which has resulted in deep shadows and flat tones. I wouldn''t know how to correct that, sorry :( But that sheen on lorikeet feathers is hard to beat isn''t it? :)', '2012-06-22 07:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800000, 1022040, 129807, '<td valign="top">This looks like a movie still from something like ''Legend of the Guardians''. Wonderful composition and processing. A little nitpick - I can see some banding in the reds, but it''s pretty minor. Overall - gorgeous!</td>', 'This looks like a movie still from something like ''Legend of the Guardians''. Wonderful composition and processing. A little nitpick - I can see some banding in the reds, but it''s pretty minor. Overall - gorgeous!', '2012-06-22 07:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800001, 1021446, 129807, '<td valign="top">Good study of a bright subject. You haven''t blown the reds and the contrast against the green bokeh bg works well. Not a fan of the border, sorry.</td>', 'Good study of a bright subject. You haven''t blown the reds and the contrast against the green bokeh bg works well. Not a fan of the border, sorry.', '2012-06-22 07:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800002, 1022115, 129807, '<td valign="top">Good work keeping so much detail in such bright light.</td>', 'Good work keeping so much detail in such bright light.', '2012-06-22 07:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800003, 1022309, 129807, '<td valign="top">Good capture, both you and the bird! I can see an incredible amount of noise in the shadow areas - present as red &amp; green dots. Maybe some NeatImage or Topaz Denoise might be in order?</td>', 'Good capture, both you and the bird! I can see an incredible amount of noise in the shadow areas - present as red & green dots. Maybe some NeatImage or Topaz Denoise might be in order?', '2012-06-22 07:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800005, 1022286, 129807, '<td valign="top">This made me smile - Splot!</td>', 'This made me smile - Splot!', '2012-06-22 07:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800006, 1022264, 129807, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. You must have amazing patience to get this. Wonderful detail, dof, colour etc. One little nitpick - I wish he was more to the left in the frame, not so centred.</td>', 'Excellent capture. You must have amazing patience to get this. Wonderful detail, dof, colour etc. One little nitpick - I wish he was more to the left in the frame, not so centred.', '2012-06-22 07:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800010, 1021950, 129807, '<td valign="top">This certainly stands out from the crowd. I like it. Have no idea how you''ve achieved it, but I like it!</td>', 'This certainly stands out from the crowd. I like it. Have no idea how you''ve achieved it, but I like it!', '2012-06-22 07:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800012, 1022248, 129807, '<td valign="top">There is nothing I can say about this that you don''t already know. Fabulous. Don''t like the uneven border, but that''s just me. Wow. Wow, wow, wow.</td>', 'There is nothing I can say about this that you don''t already know. Fabulous. Don''t like the uneven border, but that''s just me. Wow. Wow, wow, wow.', '2012-06-22 07:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
