(6800073, 1021814, 43774, '<td valign="top">So cute! I don''t have any good pics of puffins and they are our provincial bird!</td>', 'So cute! I don''t have any good pics of puffins and they are our provincial bird!', '2012-06-22 09:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
