(6804053, 1021601, 113900, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LindaJay:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m sorry to rate this so low. It is offensive (to me), and I don''t see any photo excellence that redeems it in any way. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think you are wrong on a bunch of levels.   IMHO the shot is expertly lit(in a difficult lighting situation BTW from the looks of it) and the focus is spot on.  The Bokeh is good and DOF is damn near perfect.</td>', 'Originally posted by LindaJay: I''m sorry to rate this so low. It is offensive (to me), and I don''t see any photo excellence that redeems it in any way.   I think you are wrong on a bunch of levels.   IMHO the shot is expertly lit(in a difficult lighting situation BTW from the looks of it) and the focus is spot on.  The Bokeh is good and DOF is damn near perfect.', '2012-06-29 02:22:55.000000', NULL, 0),
