(6804131, 1021262, 31409, '<td valign="top">That looks just like a chickadee bird?? I have a nest in my carport, that had 4 babies, and then one day they all left the nest!!<br/> <br/>Now there is another bird using the same nest (didn''t know birds recycled, unless it is the same Mum bird), when I looked this afternoon, 3 had hatched, with one more to go. It''s fun to watch their progress.<br/> <br/>That photo made me smile</td>', 'That looks just like a chickadee bird?? I have a nest in my carport, that had 4 babies, and then one day they all left the nest!! Now there is another bird using the same nest (didn''t know birds recycled, unless it is the same Mum bird), when I looked this afternoon, 3 had hatched, with one more to go. It''s fun to watch their progress. That photo made me smile', '2012-06-29 04:14:41.000000', NULL, 0),
