(6804211, 1022197, 67343, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for all the comments, Harveys right it was taken at a feeder, it hangs right outside of my kitchen window.  I love the hummingbirds we get a lot of them.  The lines are from the screen in the window since I knew what caused them I did not think of them being a issue next time I will know better. :)</td>', 'Thanks everyone for all the comments, Harveys right it was taken at a feeder, it hangs right outside of my kitchen window.  I love the hummingbirds we get a lot of them.  The lines are from the screen in the window since I knew what caused them I did not think of them being a issue next time I will know better. :)', '2012-06-29 08:06:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6804215, 1021769, 67343, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Blue Wendy, all you bird pictures are great. Would of been surprised if you did not win.</td>', 'Congrats on the Blue Wendy, all you bird pictures are great. Would of been surprised if you did not win.', '2012-06-29 08:16:41.000000', NULL, 0),
