(6804217, 1021769, 101668, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a lovely picture and an unbelieveable score. Well deserved.<br/>(Who gave this a 4? Or 5''s for that matter?) You just killed them</td>', 'Congrats on a lovely picture and an unbelieveable score. Well deserved.(Who gave this a 4? Or 5''s for that matter?) You just killed them', '2012-06-29 08:19:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6804219, 1022177, 107708, '<td valign="top">Taken at the Hawk Conservancy. A conservation charity and award winning visitor centre that has for many years worked in the fields of conservation, education, rehabilitation and the research of birds of prey.<br/> <br/>This is the Griffon Vulture who is very much alive and one of a few Griffons at the trust.<br/> <br/>They fly free for display and are spectacular to watch.<br/> <br/>thankyou so much for great comments :)</td>', 'Taken at the Hawk Conservancy. A conservation charity and award winning visitor centre that has for many years worked in the fields of conservation, education, rehabilitation and the research of birds of prey. This is the Griffon Vulture who is very much alive and one of a few Griffons at the trust. They fly free for display and are spectacular to watch. thankyou so much for great comments :)', '2012-06-29 08:35:43.000000', NULL, 0),
