(6804444, 1021713, 108580, '<td valign="top">I liked the shot from an interaction perspective. I new it was a bluebird but not which one.<br/>I thought the image was overexposed and the noise in the tail feathers in shade led me to believe this.<br/>good catchlight, a bug in mouth, at the nest; all good social components of a wildlife shot. I felt the light was very harsh and the shadows had to be recovered causing the appearance of editing "noise".</td>', 'I liked the shot from an interaction perspective. I new it was a bluebird but not which one.I thought the image was overexposed and the noise in the tail feathers in shade led me to believe this.good catchlight, a bug in mouth, at the nest; all good social components of a wildlife shot. I felt the light was very harsh and the shadows had to be recovered causing the appearance of editing "noise".', '2012-06-29 13:59:24.000000', NULL, 0),
