(6804621, 1021769, 19825, '<td valign="top">You may have a talent for shooting birds, Wendy. Truly stunning shot (and score). Great job. I could not complete with any of your outtakes.</td>', 'You may have a talent for shooting birds, Wendy. Truly stunning shot (and score). Great job. I could not complete with any of your outtakes.', '2012-06-29 19:29:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6804624, 1022281, 59029, '<td valign="top">LOL welcome to the crazy world of bird and wildlife photography!!  See how much fun it is with an environment and subject over which you usually have minimal, if any control? :-0<br/> <br/>I guessed right off that this was a zoo or raptor park shot.  The colour of the water, looks like  jesses were cloned out and the eagle''s got a chunk of raw meat in its talons, not fish.  Facilities like that don''t generally feed live prey, as it upsets people to see a living animal destroyed before them.  But tossing meat that the bird is accustomed to, into water, gives the bird exercise and a chance to remember that it''s supposed to get its food from water, not a handler wearing welding gloves.<br/> <br/>Still, a very good shot and I can''t tell you the number of times I''ve got a shot that would otherwise be perfect except for missed focus.  Great work!</td>', 'LOL welcome to the crazy world of bird and wildlife photography!!  See how much fun it is with an environment and subject over which you usually have minimal, if any control? :-0 I guessed right off that this was a zoo or raptor park shot.  The colour of the water, looks like  jesses were cloned out and the eagle''s got a chunk of raw meat in its talons, not fish.  Facilities like that don''t generally feed live prey, as it upsets people to see a living animal destroyed before them.  But tossing meat that the bird is accustomed to, into water, gives the bird exercise and a chance to remember that it''s supposed to get its food from water, not a handler wearing welding gloves. Still, a very good shot and I can''t tell you the number of times I''ve got a shot that would otherwise be perfect except for missed focus.  Great work!', '2012-06-29 19:42:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6804625, 1021769, 5112, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Wendy!  You da (wo)man!!!!</td>', 'Congratulations, Wendy!  You da (wo)man!!!!', '2012-06-29 19:47:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6804626, 1022243, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh, how sweet!!  Lovely, Sara!</td>', 'Oh my gosh, how sweet!!  Lovely, Sara!', '2012-06-29 19:49:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6804630, 1022281, 101581, '<td valign="top">I won''t be renewing my membership this year.<br/>Seems very little point now.<br/>It is a little unfair to parade your skills so shamelessly and subtly inform us that we are perhaps best suited to another hobby.<br/>:-)<br/>Of course this is superb !<br/>If I''m honest, I''m not a fan of the heavily manipulated images but there is no doubting your talent, <br/>Well done, again.... Grrrr<br/> <br/>;-)</td>', 'I won''t be renewing my membership this year.Seems very little point now.It is a little unfair to parade your skills so shamelessly and subtly inform us that we are perhaps best suited to another hobby.:-)Of course this is superb !If I''m honest, I''m not a fan of the heavily manipulated images but there is no doubting your talent, Well done, again.... Grrrr ;-)', '2012-06-29 19:57:05.000000', NULL, 0),
