(6804677, 1021542, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really nice the way he stands out against the background and great detail in the dark of the feathers.  I like crows!</td>', 'Really nice the way he stands out against the background and great detail in the dark of the feathers.  I like crows!', '2012-06-29 21:51:26.000000', NULL, 0),
