(6804861, 1022281, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gcoulson:</b></div><hr/><i> Christophe, this is an outstanding image. Curious to know if the water was truly this spectacular blue, or whether this was enhance a little in PS? Just great timing on the shot, and the detail is wonderful! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks a lot! It''s no news: I like to process my shots extensively, and this one is no exception. Colors were all tweaked to maximize visual impact.</td>', 'Originally posted by gcoulson: Christophe, this is an outstanding image. Curious to know if the water was truly this spectacular blue, or whether this was enhance a little in PS? Just great timing on the shot, and the detail is wonderful!   Thanks a lot! It''s no news: I like to process my shots extensively, and this one is no exception. Colors were all tweaked to maximize visual impact.', '2012-06-30 13:20:06.000000', NULL, 0),
