(6804939, 1022281, 103142, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if this was in a captive environment -- to get a shot like that in less than a week in the wild would be incredibly difficult. :)<br/> <br/>Even so, it''s still a difficult capture and I only play with 400mm. Can''t imagine trying with a 600. Beautifully done!<br/> <br/>(Was without a computer for a week, so my congrats are a bit belated.)</td>', 'I was wondering if this was in a captive environment -- to get a shot like that in less than a week in the wild would be incredibly difficult. :) Even so, it''s still a difficult capture and I only play with 400mm. Can''t imagine trying with a 600. Beautifully done! (Was without a computer for a week, so my congrats are a bit belated.)', '2012-06-30 19:00:49.000000', NULL, 0),
