(6875921, 1021601, 35357, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  A great shot, emotive, interesting, beautiful bokeh, and fits the challenge.  Maybe a bit too centred composition for the two-thirds-rule-mongers of DPC and the lighting could be much more dramatic.  Achieving the brown with a shot like this is hilarious confirmation of the number of dried up, scaly-cunted grannies voting on this site, LOL!  I guess that''s why they invented KY, because who''d go down on one of them?<br/> <br/>Anyhow, I''m fairly inspired to start entering challenges again after seeing this!</td>', 'Sweet!  A great shot, emotive, interesting, beautiful bokeh, and fits the challenge.  Maybe a bit too centred composition for the two-thirds-rule-mongers of DPC and the lighting could be much more dramatic.  Achieving the brown with a shot like this is hilarious confirmation of the number of dried up, scaly-cunted grannies voting on this site, LOL!  I guess that''s why they invented KY, because who''d go down on one of them? Anyhow, I''m fairly inspired to start entering challenges again after seeing this!', '2012-10-04 20:54:11.000000', NULL, 0),
