(6931526, 1021601, 63218, '<td valign="top">Not offended. A little bored, maybe. I think you didn''t push it far enough. It would be a more offensive, more confrontational photo if you''d been looking directly into the lens with all the name-calling names in the world in your eyes &amp; a sneer on your lips. Change the T-shirt  to a plain dark color so we can see your gesture better. Take it to the wall. I''m pretty sure nobody''s got nothing but 1-votes. If anyone can, it will be you. Consider this a triple-dog-dare!</td>', 'Not offended. A little bored, maybe. I think you didn''t push it far enough. It would be a more offensive, more confrontational photo if you''d been looking directly into the lens with all the name-calling names in the world in your eyes & a sneer on your lips. Change the T-shirt  to a plain dark color so we can see your gesture better. Take it to the wall. I''m pretty sure nobody''s got nothing but 1-votes. If anyone can, it will be you. Consider this a triple-dog-dare!', '2012-12-13 10:43:45.000000', NULL, 0),
